# Family Night (Kid's Badges)

## Burnie the Phoenix
<img src="https://github.com/cyberm3n-org/SC_2026/blob/main/ref_images/Burnie_Front.png">
By: ERE

### Build List Items
| Ref | Value | Marking Color |
| D1 | Orange LED | Orange |
| D2, D3 | Red LED | Red |
| R1 | 100 | Purple |
| R2 | 150 | Red |

### Steps
1. Solder LEDs
2. Solder Resistor
3. [OPTIONAL] Apply hot glue to difuse light

## Foxie
