By: ADE

### Build List Items
| Ref | Value | Marking Color |
| D1 | Orange LED | Orange |
| D2, D3 | White LED | Yellow |
| R1 | 100 | Purple |
| R2 | 30 | Orange |

### Steps
1. Solder LEDs
2. Solder Resistor
3. [OPTIONAL] Apply hot glue to difuse light